s</h2><p>Each stage produces the information needed for the next purchasing decision.</p></div><ol class="OemPage_process__21ca5"><li><span>01</span><h3>Project Brief</h3><p>Share the market, product list, estimated quantity and branding needs.</p></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Feasibility Review</h3><p>We review construction, materials, marking, packaging and development requirements.</p></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Design Confirmation</h3><p>Product specifications, artwork placement and packing details are recorded for approval.</p></li><li><span>04</span><h3>Sample Approval</h3><p>The physical sample is checked against the confirmed project details before production.</p></li><li><span>05</span><h3>Production &amp; QC</h3><p>Production follows the approved reference with in-process and final inspection records.</p></li><li><span>06</span><h3>Shipment Support</h3><p>Packing, shipment preparation and order documents are coordinated for dispatch.</p></li></ol></section><section class="OemPage_section__U3uZN OemPage_brandingSection__4U7H2" aria-labelledby="branding-title"><div class="OemPage_brandingMedia__kBW3O"><img alt="Blank recessed and brushed steel dumbbell surfaces for custom branding" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 43vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Foem%2Fbranding-methods-macro.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="OemPage_brandingCopy__1v1NF"><h2 id="branding-title">Choose the Right Branding Method</h2><div class="OemPage_tableWrap__Mc0v4"><table><thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Best For</th><th>Finish</th><th>Project Review</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Raised Logo</td><td>Strong molded visibility</td><td>Integrated 3D surface</td><td>Logo size, height and position</td></tr><tr><td>Recessed Logo</td><td>Clean molded branding</td><td>Indented surface</td><td>Depth, font and placement</td></tr><tr><td>Laser Marking</td><td>Steel handles and end caps</td><td>Permanent etched mark</td><td>Marking area and contrast</td></tr><tr><td>Printed Marking</td><td>Color and detailed graphics</td><td>Printed surface system</td><td>Color, placement and durability</td></tr><tr><td>Custom End Cap</td><td>Distinct dumbbell identity</td><td>Fitted branded component</td><td>Cap design, fit and fixing method</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="OemPage_section__U3uZN OemPage_sampleSection__0A7_Z" aria-labelledby="sample-title"><div><h2 id="sample-title">Approve the Sample Before Production</h2><p>A physical sample gives your team a clear reference for the product details that matter to your market.</p><ul><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-scale"><path d="m16 16 3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1Z"></path><path d="m2 16 3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1Z"></path><path d="M7 21h10"></path><path d="M12 3v18"></path><path d="M3 7h2c2 0 5-1 7-2 2 1 5 2 7 2h2"></path></svg><span><strong>Dimensions &amp; Weight</strong>Check the physical product against the confirmed specification.</span></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-stamp"><path d="M5 22h14"></path><path d="M19.27 13.73A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 17.5 13h-11A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 15.5V17a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1.5c0-.66-.26-1.3-.73-1.77Z"></path><path d="M14 13V8.5C14 7 15 7 15 5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3c-1.66 0-3 1-3 3s1 2 1 3.5V13"></path></svg><span><strong>Logo &amp; Marking</strong>Approve content, position, size and finish.</span></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-palette"><circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z"></path></svg><span><strong>Color &amp; Finish</strong>Review material appearance and surface treatment.</span></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-box"><path d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"></path><path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5"></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path></svg><span><strong>Packaging &amp; Labels</strong>Confirm protection, artwork and packing presentation.</span><